WEBVTT

NOTE Original animated birthday film — descriptive captions (no spoken lines).

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
♪ Once upon a golden evening, the garden guests gathered…

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
The birthday girl arrives, and the bunny brings a flower.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Momo spots a strawberry. The bunny spots Momo. [boing]

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
Three little candles. One big wish.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
And… the first slice! [chime]

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
Hip hip hooray! Confetti for everyone. [cheers]

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
Momo, wait, where are you going? [whoosh]
